# D3-FE-008: Cold storage followed by warming is a history, not a new culture
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 5C
add v1 sucrose 1g
add v1 yoghurt_culture 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL @ 40C
add v2 sucrose 1g
add v2 yoghurt_culture 0.5g
wait 4h
inspect
heat v1 7.3kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
wait 4h
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
